  "body": "Get ready to move into a home designed with families in mind or seeking low maintenance. This brand-new home combines modern comfort with everyday convenience in one of  the newest developments in Orewa .   \r\n\r\n What you'll love:\r\n\r\n* 3 double bedrooms - including a master with ensuite for parents' retreat\r\n\r\n* 2 modern bathrooms with quality fittings to make busy mornings easier\r\n\r\n* Bright open-plan living and dining, opening to an outdoor space perfect for barbecues and playtime\r\n\r\n* Stylish, practical kitchen fitted with quality appliances\r\n\r\n* Internal-access single garage for secure parking and extra storage\r\n\r\n*  Deck flows from the living room and main bedroom\r\n\r\nSet within a thoughtfully designed development featuring landscaped green areas and welcoming public spaces, this is a neighbourhood where kids can play and families can thrive. You'll also enjoy being close to Orewa's beautiful beach, local schools, sports facilities, and easy motorway links - everything your family needs, right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nPhotos are virtual staging and from an identical floor layout.\r\n\r\nViewing access: Set GPS to Mahinga Kai Road, take 1st right (Ara Taha Cresent), 2nd left is Kopu Road.  Access also through Flavell Drive.",
